#: .\templates\portfolio\project_customer_segmentation.html:27
msgid "Customer Personality Segmentation (MIT IDSS – Capstone Project)"
msgstr "Segmentação de Perfis de Clientes (MIT IDSS – Projeto de Conclusão)"

#: .\templates\portfolio\project_customer_segmentation.html:30
msgid ""
"As part of a capstone project from the Massachusetts Institute of Technology "
"(MIT) Institute for Data, Systems, and Society (IDSS), a customer "
"segmentation system was developed using a retail dataset containing "
"demographic attributes, purchase behaviour, campaign responses, and spending "
"habits."
msgstr ""
"Como parte de um projeto de conclusão do Institute for Data, Systems, and "
"Society (IDSS), do Instituto de Tecnologia de Massachusetts (MIT), foi "
"desenvolvido um sistema de segmentação de clientes usando um conjunto de "
"dados de varejo com atributos demográficos, comportamento de compra, "
"respostas a campanhas e hábitos de consumo."

#: .\templates\portfolio\project_customer_segmentation.html:39
msgid ""
"The process began with data cleaning — handling duplicates, missing values, "
"outliers, and inconsistencies — followed by univariate and bivariate "
"analysis to explore patterns in customer behaviour."
msgstr ""
"O processo começou com a limpeza dos dados — tratamento de duplicatas, "
"valores ausentes, outliers e inconsistências — seguida de análises "
"univariada e bivariada para explorar padrões no comportamento dos clientes."

#: .\templates\portfolio\project_customer_segmentation.html:47
msgid ""
"Features were engineered from purchase history, campaign responses, and "
"household data, and several clustering algorithms were implemented and "
"compared:"
msgstr ""
"Foram criadas variáveis a partir do histórico de compras, das respostas a "
"campanhas e dos dados domiciliares, e vários algoritmos de clusterização "
"foram implementados e comparados:"

#: .\templates\portfolio\project_customer_segmentation.html:55
msgid "K-Means"
msgstr "K-Means"

#: .\templates\portfolio\project_customer_segmentation.html:56
msgid "K-Medoids"
msgstr "K-Medoids"

#: .\templates\portfolio\project_customer_segmentation.html:57
msgid "Agglomerative Clustering"
msgstr "Clusterização Aglomerativa"

#: .\templates\portfolio\project_customer_segmentation.html:58
msgid "Gaussian Mixture Models"
msgstr "Modelos de Mistura Gaussiana"

#: .\templates\portfolio\project_customer_segmentation.html:62
msgid ""
"Silhouette scores, the elbow method, and cluster interpretability guided "
"model selection. The final solution produced actionable customer profiles to "
"support tailored marketing campaigns and retention strategies."
msgstr ""
"Os coeficientes de silhueta, o método do cotovelo e a interpretabilidade dos "
"clusters orientaram a seleção do modelo. A solução final produziu perfis de "
"clientes acionáveis para apoiar campanhas de marketing personalizadas e "
"estratégias de retenção."

