msgstr "Gestão de Relacionamento com Clientes (CRM) SaaS Multi-tenant"

#: .\templates\portfolio\project_trade_crm.html:39
msgid ""
"Trade CRM is a Django-based multi-tenant CRM solution for trade and service "
"businesses. The project is currently in MVP development, with tenant signup, "
"authentication, role-based permissions, clients, jobs, staff workflows, and "
"a dynamic pricebook already implemented."
msgstr ""
"O Trade CRM é uma solução de CRM multi-tenant baseada em Django para "
"empresas prestadoras de serviços e profissionais de campo. O projeto está "
